 makes you look organized, respectful, and serious about their program 🎯\\n\\n#collegerecruiting #scholarship #scholarships\",\n        \"altText\": null,\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-05-18T16:22:14.000Z\",\n        \"owner\": {\n          \"id\": \"57371851084\",\n          \"handle\": \"troycagleofficial\",\n          \"displayName\": \"Troy Cagle | College Recruiting Coach\",\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://scontent-lax3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-19/582099469_17983911869915085_5917426700666836208_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e0_s150x150_tt6&_nc_cat=108&ig_cache_key=GA0isiLNn63GReQ-APCUqH077B5SbmNDAQAB1501500j-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=669407&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy4zMjAuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=o-EjOVQawakQ7kNvwFQjIi6&_nc_oc=AdovZpRCPrOtXqm97_cu_NIvGaiFIvx7yDA027hXcc4zd7NINO25Aifo_StLPVwM8zE&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-lax3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=jT35p9eKZ_u0Ytb1BCKOwQ&_nc_ss=723ba&oh=00_AQQVp84g1BEel-FcTtg509z4bcUJ0f42RmFLfKGv4pgH_g&oe=6AF3CB83\",\n          \"verified\": true,\n          \"privateAccount\": false\n        },\n        \"metrics\": {\n          \"likeCount\": 12723,\n          \"commentCount\": 178,\n          \"playCount\": 239996,\n          \"shareCount\": 1718,\n          \"saveCount\": null,\n          \"likesHidden\": false\n        },\n        \"imageUrl\": \"https://scontent-lax3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/684686831_2837104953288912_767416579200325498_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=108&ig_cache_key=Mzg5OTg3NDQ0MDkzODc1MDQ5NDEwMjM0NjkyODM1ODE2NjY%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjY0MC5zZHIudmlkZW9fbmZyYW1lX2NvdmVyX2ZyYW1lLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=MAU2-xpZmxYQ7kNvwHI5C7Y&_nc_oc=Adon2--otWektPfuNvmV6HfHJNBapEEHjiGlElUFbMQc6ggWWbku5LGbek0qKtcr3iM&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-lax3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=jT35p9eKZ_u0Ytb1BCKOwQ&_nc_ss=723ba&oh=00_AQTB7kN4IWRKy_Nd1mKGDFfdYEhtoyZlDXq8GzVXS01G_g&oe=6AF3E8DE\",\n        \"thumbnailUrl\": \"http