"reel","mediaType":"video","caption":"Comment “SPACE” and I’ll send you the full recruiting email guide for free 📲\n\nWhen a college coach asks for a phone call how you respond will determine whether that call ever happens\n\nHere is exactly what to say 👇\n\nNever say you are available right now: It makes you look desperate and gives the coach a reason to stop responding altogether\n\nGive them options: Let the coach know you are interested and list three specific days and times you are available so they can simply check their calendar and pick one\n\nLeave the door open: End by letting them know you are flexible if none of those times work so the conversation never hits a dead end\n\nOne simple response makes you look organized, respectful, and serious about their program 🎯\n\n#collegerecruiting #scholarship #scholarships","altText":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-18T16:22:14.000Z","owner":{"id":"57371851084","handle":"troycagleofficial","displayName":"Troy Cagle | College Recruiting Coach","avatarUrl":"https://scontent-lax3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-19/582099469_17983911869915085_5917426700666836208_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e0_s150x150_tt6&_nc_cat=108&ig_cache_key=GA0isiLNn63GReQ-APCUqH077B5SbmNDAQAB1501500j-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=669407&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy4zMjAuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=o-EjOVQawakQ7kNvwFQjIi6&_nc_oc=AdovZpRCPrOtXqm97_cu_NIvGaiFIvx7yDA027hXcc4zd7NINO25Aifo_StLPVwM8zE&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-lax3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=jT35p9eKZ_u0Ytb1BCKOwQ&_nc_ss=723ba&oh=00_AQQVp84g1BEel-FcTtg509z4bcUJ0f42RmFLfKGv4pgH_g&oe=6AF3CB83","verified":true,"privateAccount":false},"metrics":{"likeCount":12723,"commentCount":178,"playCount":239996,"shareCount":1718,"saveCount":null,"likesHidden":false},"imageUrl":"https://scontent-lax3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/684686831_2837104953288912_767416579200325498_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=108&ig_cache_key=Mzg5OTg3NDQ0MDkzODc1MDQ5NDEwMjM0NjkyODM1ODE2NjY%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5